<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-FERENCVAROS BEAT BOHEMIANS 5-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FERENCVAROS BEAT BOHEMIANS 5-0.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferencvaros (Hungary) beat Bohemians Dublin (Ireland) 5-0 (halftime 1-0) in the second leg of the preliminary round of the UEFA Cup. Ferencvaros won the first leg 1-0.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ferencvaros:</p>
<p>Florian Albert 15</p>
<p>Zoltan Jagodics 47, 74</p>
<p>Levente Schultz 58</p>
<p>Gabor Zavadszky 71</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,170.</p>
